      "words": 8
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He thinks Shadowick doesn’t know what to do with freedom. He said the Priestess kept things orderly and that I shouldn’t",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3349
        }
      ],
      "words": 25
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He came with lots of open-ended threats.” My gaze went back to Keegan’s. “He asked what happens when the second Ward goe",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3716
        }
      ],
      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But I have some intriguing news. The shadows stopped listening to Darren,” I told them",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4665
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Yeah, it now comes with a glowing option, if I so choose",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5444
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The Stone Ward is gone, but I can still feel magic here",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6030
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
